  "intraday_notes": [
    {
      "id": "note-ca64b7658807",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-20 09:49:00 EDT",
      "text": "開盤TR micro DT BO，可以在1R、TR低點Long Limit",
      "created_at": "2026-09-24T04:24:56.271707+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-24T04:24:56.271713+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-cf188c5e5959",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-20 09:54:00 EDT",
      "text": "打到1R 馬上收長下影線\nTP抓50%、這根高點",
      "created_at": "2026-09-24T04:25:55.976682+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-24T04:25:55.976694+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-fb36f32bc5f8",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-20 09:59:00 EDT",
      "text": "1m 階梯下跌 目前還是偏開盤震盪\n波幅0.5以上要拿TR BO 1R有困難 接下來應該偏單向震盪",
      "created_at": "2026-09-24T04:28:01.871801+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-24T04:28:01.871808+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-df28429664d3",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-20 10:09:00 EDT",
      "text": "Bull strong SB，但是超過TR 50%\n1. 賭BUll BO、Bull 震盪向上\n2. 賭還在1m下半區震盪 Short Limit\n選擇1、用Long Limit拿好位置",
      "created_at": "2026-09-24T04:30:14.489607+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-24T04:30:14.489615+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-f427740b799c",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-20 10:19:00 EDT",
      "text": "SB Confirm Failed，選擇SOTB或是守停損嘗試TR BE",
      "created_at": "2026-09-24T04:31:53.833880+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-24T04:31:53.833889+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-00950855bfc0",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-20 10:20:00 EDT",
      "text": "這根下去插停損後BE，應該是被打停損",
      "created_at": "2026-09-24T04:33:03.134600+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-24T04:33:03.134610+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-dd7c65c47064",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-20 10:34:00 EDT",
      "text": "這邊看有沒有1m second leg trap",
      "created_at": "2026-09-24T04:41:51.726216+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-24T04:41:51.726229+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-73b9038d62d5",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-20 10:44:00 EDT",
      "text": "結構有點改變 Bull BO 有FT，Bull market\n如果收陰線馬上離場 second leg trap",
      "created_at": "2026-09-24T04:43:20.390583+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-24T04:43:20.390589+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-c337570f8d2d",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-20 10:54:00 EDT",
      "text": "這邊賭micro WBO，直接下像突破",
      "created_at": "2026-09-24T04:44:39.857309+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-24T04:44:39.857315+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-6dbff6f8135e",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-20 11:09:00 EDT",
      "text": "一樣賭micro WBO\n目標拿1.5~2R",
      "created_at": "2026-09-24T04:45:35.171462+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-24T04:47:10.846474+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-5464a8d593fa",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-20 11:54:00 EDT",
      "text": "打到market order 1R開始反彈這邊有可能12點反轉先離場\n等看是小反轉還是大反轉",
      "created_at": "2026-09-24T04:47:56.172292+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-24T04:48:09.020347+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-d86443c6ba9d",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-20 12:14:00 EDT",
      "text": "反轉後小震盪，今天兩種走法:\n1. 下去補波幅拿bear second leg\n2. 0.7%波幅 全天震盪\n選擇等向下突破後看有沒有Long Limit機會",
      "created_at": "2026-09-24T04:50:17.218370+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-24T04:50:17.218376+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-32bdfde459a2",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-20 12:54:00 EDT",
      "text": "看起來是嘗試測前高全天震盪\n前高Short Limit\n前低Long Limit",
      "created_at": "2026-09-24T04:50:43.278931+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-24T04:51:15.707394+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-cd4dc8a30e8d",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-20 14:36:00 EDT",
      "text": "結果是大反彈後下來補波幅\n那尾盤應該下半區震盪多Limit看有沒有BE機會",
      "created_at": "2026-09-24T04:53:26.151643+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-24T04:53:26.151652+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-101f2918bd86",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-20 15:07:00 EDT",
      "text": "Long Limit 拿到BE",
      "created_at": "2026-09-24T04:54:01.052468+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-24T04:54:01.052474+00:00"
    }
  ],
